{"parse": {"title": "太阳的背面-03", "pageid": 84869, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-02\" title=\"太阳的背面-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">太阳的背面-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-04\" title=\"太阳的背面-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">太阳的背面</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E7.BF.BC.E9.A3.9E.E9.B8.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无翼飞鸟\">无翼飞鸟</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无翼飞鸟</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fallen Swan</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2350103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闹剧结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>花园中稀疏的植物被这场意外搅弄得东倒西歪，淡紫色的土豆花落在了土壤上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai2\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖母：</div><div>真好啊，又是土豆丰收的季节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖母：</div><div>夏洛特，今天的早餐是土豆泥哦，特地加了很多甜奶油的土豆泥——你最爱吃这些了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……教练不让我吃这些。“自由祭祀”需要运动员保持身材。教练说，如果要拿到金牌，就一定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖母：</div><div>可怜的小夏洛特……连饭都不能吃饱了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖母：</div><div>我们都知道你是乖孩子，也很喜欢“自由祭祀”。但每天要做这么多的训练，你又这么小，总得吃饱了才有力气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖母：</div><div>只吃一小口，怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>一小口……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>——你早上吃了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她紧紧地盯着女孩胸前残余的一小块土豆泥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>奶油土豆泥？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她陡然拔高了声调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我和你说过多少次了！如果你还想取得成绩，就不能再吃这些东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……我只是在补充热量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她知道自己在狡辩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>三天后就是乌卢鲁预选赛，你想过这个问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>还是说，你以为有了那一点可笑的天赋，就拥有了在赛场上傲慢的资格？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>如果你是这么认为的，那么我现在就要告诉你，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人露出了一个残酷的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你是个彻头彻尾的废物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>在乌卢鲁的赛场上，从来不缺少天才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我知道我做得不对——但为什么要这样羞辱我……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>羞辱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷酷的女人忽然笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>如果你认为这是羞辱，那我只能告诉你——你差得太远了，你不配和其他选手在同一个赛场上角逐那块金牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>当然，这也是你的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人轻飘飘地扔下了一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>去啊，去吃你最喜欢的奶油土豆泥吧；然后取消上午的训练，因为你要保证足够的睡眠……噢，下午的训练也尽可以取消了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>运动可太辛苦了，不仅要忍受肌肉的酸痛，还要控制饮食、受到教练的责骂。你可是尊贵的奥黑根小姐啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>这样尊贵的小姐，怎么能在乌卢鲁的红土地上流汗呢？她就该坐在观众席上才对——是了，至少还得有遮阳伞和冷饮，我说得对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我不会再在你身上浪费精力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>严苛的女人朝她露出了一个冷笑，随后头也不回地离开了训练场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慢慢地握紧了拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>该死的——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我才不是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一拳砸在墙壁上，指骨传来的疼痛令她心有不甘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我才不是奥黑根小姐……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬紧牙关，鼻腔酸涩。<br />但最后她忍住了，没有让泪水超越眼眶的边界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我会拿到金牌的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重重地把腿压在墙上，整个身体呈现出不可思议的柔软弧度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空荡的训练室内，只有她一个人在练习那些枯燥的动作，她一遍又一遍地跳起、落下。柔软的身躯在空中划出优美的弧线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-628913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-628913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-628913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>0.2，0.5，0.3，0.7，0.4……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在心中默默地记录着每个动作的分数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接下来，是最为重要的神秘术环节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闭上了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无形的能量正在空气中流转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>呼，盛……日之眼，平衡的守护者，你是……无尽之泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>疗愈的苏利丝，闪耀的苏利丝……神圣的苏利丝。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_yuhuoduitan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐约的光芒在眼前浮现。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>你温暖我们的灵魂，拯救我们的伤口，也将赐予我们无尽的超脱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那光芒温暖如春天，她朝它伸出了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>只要我能够触摸到您的衣角……那流溢而慈爱的光辉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我……是我做错了什么吗？为什么我的眼睛看不见您的光辉……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身侧的能量还在流溢着，它们鼓动着她的发丝，拂动着体操服上柔软的羽毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我为什么看不见您？您又为什么拒绝我？我要怎样才能获得您的垂青呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无尽的黑暗中，只有她的声音在回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>只要您愿意，我可以拿我拥有的一切来交换——只要能让我拿到那块金牌，我什么都愿意付出！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-628813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-628813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-628813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳畔传来了不应在此刻出现的声音，女孩惊慌地睁开了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>您怎么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我来拿录音机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……录音机？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>录音机是公用的设施，它一直被放置在训练室内——通常情况下，并不会有人特意将它拿走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>夏洛特，竞技体育的残酷之处就在于，即使你付出了一切，也极有可能一无所有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人自顾自地说了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我原本以为你会明白这一切，但没想到你是个令人叹为观止的蠢货。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>想想你的前辈吧。西尔莎，所有人都认为她一定能拿下那一届冠军，包括她的对手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>最后因为一次偶然的伤病，她去不了了，只能从别人的嘴里听到乌卢鲁这三个字——后来发生了什么，你应当比我更清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……她从伦敦桥上跳了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>——你又凭什么认为，这样的命运不会发生在你的身上？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声未曾预想的呵斥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>把你刚刚的动作再跳一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>马上就到预选赛了，怎么还能跳成这样？你既然不能感知“自由祭祀”的神秘术涌动，就绝不能在这些地方犯错。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "太阳的背面-03"}}